==Battleground==
*5 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawns after 30.67 seconds<sup>920f</sup>.
*1 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCO]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawns after 84 seconds<sup>2,520f</sup>.
*Infinite [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[ALLEN O'NEIL (Enemy)|ALLEN O'NEIL]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)|MARS PEOPLE]] spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[MARCO (Enemy)|MARCO]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Even in 4♛ the stage is a joke because pretty the enemy stats are low enough for many [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] or [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] to simply overrun the stage. In particular, [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] or [[Li'l Giraffe Cat|Li'l Giraffe Cat's]] fast attack rate and good speed pretty much guarantee getting the timed rewards.

